            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ],
          "value": "解决NSCLC中ICI原发性和获得性耐药限制长期临床获益的问题；阐明TME各组分如何协同导致不同免疫表型，并厘清当前联合治疗策略的证据等级与局限性。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::2ebf71c6aa2b1657b267b130",
            "snapshot::153461ac1a5cb9b5a31c3121",
            "snapshot::e83de03b33da0c831779d170"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch5",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_005\\c8a8e196a35945b70bab58ac7d25825d55761abfe16e04e3930ca8753de1bb61\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0474"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::16c76a5912d11aab9f5c31be",
          "source_handle": "P0474",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ],
          "value": "非小细胞肺癌（NSCLC）患者中，肿瘤微环境（TME）介导的免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）耐药机制、联合治疗策略及生物标志物框架。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::2ebf71c6aa2b1657b267b130",
            "snapshot::153461ac1a5cb9b5a31c3121",
            "snapshot::e83de03b33da0c831779d170"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch5",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_005\\c8a8e196a35945b70bab58ac7d25825d55761abfe16e04e3930ca8753de1bb61\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0474"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::f8fa25779ca4c2210b5be95b",
          "source_handle": "P0474",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ],
          "value": "本文是一篇叙事性综述，旨在将TME介导的ICI耐药视为一个相互连接的生物学过程，而非孤立因素的集合。文章系统梳理了免疫抑制细胞群、基质重塑、血管功能障碍、缺氧、代谢重编程以及抗原呈递缺陷和致癌驱动信号如何协同作用，形成免疫沙漠、免疫排斥或耗竭性炎症表型。在此基础上，综述评估了针对这些机制的联合治疗策略，区分了III期支持的临床标准与早期探索性方法，并提出了整合PD-L1、TMB、干扰素γ特征、空间组学、ctDNA等指标的操作化生物标志物框架，以指导NSCLC的精准免疫治疗。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::2ebf71c6aa2b1657b267b130",
            "snapshot::153461ac1a5cb9b5a31c3121",
            "snapshot::e83de03b33da0c831779d170"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch5",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_005\\c8a8e196a35945b70bab58ac7d25825d55761abfe16e04e3930ca8753de1bb61\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0474"
