          "chapter_id": "Ch1"
        },
        {
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "描述了使用随机森林分类器结合分类和功能特征进行预测的方法及其在独立队列中的验证结果（AUC 0.625）。"
          },
          "atom_id": "atom::d8d685292f4d4da100d52e17",
          "chapter_id": "Ch1"
        },
        {
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "该研究的发现主要针对转移性黑色素瘤患者，不能直接外推至其他类型的实体瘤或早期癌症。",
          "atom_id": "atom::9850b88954dd7321ed9665a6",
          "chapter_id": "Ch1"
        },
        {
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "差异丰度分析未进行多重检验校正，因此列出的差异物种和通路应视为探索性发现，需谨慎解读其特异性。",
          "atom_id": "atom::d4b5fe41bcb0eea6090fae30",
          "chapter_id": "Ch1"
        },
        {
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "验证队列样本量较小（N=27），导致预后分析的统计效力不足，P值不显著不代表无关联，而是无法拒绝零假设。",
          "atom_id": "atom::f9561956f0c2ffde516d2ae5",
          "chapter_id": "Ch1"
        },
        {
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "功能分析基于宏基因组测序推断的基因潜力，不等于实际表达的蛋白质或代谢物水平。",
          "atom_id": "atom::babf9813e2e60abff9175834",
          "chapter_id": "Ch1"
        }
      ],
      "key_findings": [
        {
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "pooled MM patients (N=130), unadjusted Wilcoxon test",
            "finding": "响应者（R）中富集的物种包括Faecalibacterium属、Ruminococcaceae科未知种、Barnesiella intestinihominis和Ruminococcus bicirculans；非响应者（NR）中富集Bacteroides thetaiotaomicron、Adlercreutzia equolifaciens等。"
          },
          "atom_id": "atom::7c28e449234e1015730954e3",
          "chapter_id": "Ch1"
        },
        {
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "pooled MM patients, MetaCyc pathways",
            "finding": "响应者中富集29个差异代谢通路，主要涉及维生素B代谢（硫胺素、钴胺素）、淀粉/糖苷降解及肽聚糖成熟；非响应者中富集核苷酸生物合成和好氧呼吸通路（部分由Campylobacter和Citrobacter驱动）。"
          },
          "atom_id": "atom::d0c260a1ef0fdd89c3f4b239",
          "chapter_id": "Ch1"
        },
        {
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "independent validation cohort (Peters et al., N=27)",
            "finding": "基于训练集特征训练的RF分类器在验证集上达到AUC=0.624 (95% CI: 0.348-0.899)。根据分类结果分组，响应者组的无进展生存期（PFS）风险比HR=0.35，但未达到统计学显著性（P=0.081），作者归因于样本量不足导致的统计效力低。"
          },
          "atom_id": "atom::1fc1719e2f84d3ef36ac1a91",
          "chapter_id": "Ch1"
        }
      ],
