          ],
          "value": "empirical",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::876d049940377080941b53c1"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0511"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::7050aedeb5fae84b617bd737",
          "source_handle": "P0511",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ],
          "value": "肠道微生物组的特征在不同患者队列中是否具有普遍适用性以预测癌症免疫治疗（ICI）的疗效？是否存在一致的微生物组成或功能签名来区分ICI治疗的响应者与未响应者？",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::876d049940377080941b53c1"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0511"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::c1fd6ecce3da93617b89cc09",
          "source_handle": "P0511",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ],
          "value": "转移性黑色素瘤（MM）患者，接受抗PD-1、抗CTLA-4或联合免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗。研究基于4项已发表的粪便宏基因组鸟枪法测序（MGS）数据，共130名患者（66名响应者R，64名非响应者NR），并使用Peters等的一项独立队列（27名MM患者）进行验证。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::876d049940377080941b53c1"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0511"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::e396d9f078e9bdde5d4f8296",
          "source_handle": "P0511",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ],
          "value": "本研究旨在通过荟萃分析确定跨不同患者队列预测ICI治疗响应的肠道微生物组特征。作者对来自4项研究的公开MGS数据进行重新处理和分析，比较响应者与未响应者在分类学组成和功能代谢通路上的差异。研究发现，尽管整体群落结构（Alpha/Beta多样性）在组间无显著差异，但存在一组特定的物种和代谢通路在响应者中富集。基于这些差异特征构建的随机森林分类器在训练集中表现适度，并在独立验证队列中以AUC=0.625区分了响应状态，且该分类预测与无进展生存期（PFS）呈趋势性相关（HR=0.35, P=0.081）。结论认为存在一个跨研究的粪便微生物组签名，可能用于诊断或治疗目的，但需进一步验证。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::876d049940377080941b53c1"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0511"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::757d1e0f130f3664010486ba",
          "source_handle": "P0511",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "研究对象仅限于转移性黑色素瘤；使用的是回顾性荟萃分析数据，非前瞻性干预试验；统计方法未校正多重比较。",
            "contribution": "提供了跨多个独立队列一致的微生物分类学和功能性特征列表，证明某些微生物特征（如Faecalibacterium富集和维生素B代谢增强）与ICI响应正相关。",
            "facet_id": "F1"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::876d049940377080941b53c1"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0511"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::9823649fbf3e7619cc1e6ec1",
          "source_handle": "P0511",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "这是基于基因含量推断的功能潜力，而非直接测量的代谢物浓度或免疫细胞活性；因果关系尚未证实，仅为相关性观察和推测。",
            "contribution": "提出了潜在的机制线索：响应者中富集的维生素B代谢通路（特别是硫胺素和钴胺素）可能与免疫系统激活有关；非响应者中的好氧呼吸通路可能与机会性病原体相关。",
            "facet_id": "F2"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::876d049940377080941b53c1"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0511"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::60f1fd980dfd49492b0393df",
          "source_handle": "P0511",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "讨论了全球微生物结构（Alpha/Beta多样性）在响应者和非响应者之间缺乏显著差异，指出个体异质性、地理因素和实验设计偏差的影响。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::876d049940377080941b53c1"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0511"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::d8d685292f4d4da100d52e17",
          "source_handle": "P0511",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "描述了使用随机森林分类器结合分类和功能特征进行预测的方法及其在独立队列中的验证结果（AUC 0.625）。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::876d049940377080941b53c1"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0511"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::9850b88954dd7321ed9665a6",
          "source_handle": "P0511",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "该研究的发现主要针对转移性黑色素瘤患者，不能直接外推至其他类型的实体瘤或早期癌症。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::876d049940377080941b53c1"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0511"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::d4b5fe41bcb0eea6090fae30",
          "source_handle": "P0511",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "差异丰度分析未进行多重检验校正，因此列出的差异物种和通路应视为探索性发现，需谨慎解读其特异性。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::876d049940377080941b53c1"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
