          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0532"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::27849e2682f5ca0e4d6edbc7",
          "source_handle": "P0532",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ],
          "value": "采用叙述性综述方法。作者系统检索并整理了近年来关于肠道微生物与各类癌症治疗相互作用的研究文献。结构上，先按治疗类型（放疗、化疗、靶向、免疫、中药、康复）分类讨论微生物的影响；再按生物学机制（代谢、免疫、生物物理、胞内定植、DNA损伤）归纳深层原理；最后评估临床转化现状与挑战。文中引用了大量动物模型实验、临床试验结果及体外研究数据，并通过图表（Figure 1, 2, 3; Table 1, 2）可视化关键微生物、治疗方式及机制之间的联系。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::985cab2b009c52150a529179"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0532"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::10955ca45dfa3dfb1db68a2f",
          "source_handle": "P0532",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits"
          ],
          "value": {
            "contribution": "提供了肠道微生物影响多种癌症治疗模式的系统性框架，将分散的机制（代谢、免疫、生物物理等）与治疗类型（放化疗、免疫、靶向等）进行了交叉关联。",
            "limits": "作为综述，主要汇总已有观察性研究和部分临床前/临床证据，缺乏原创性的因果验证实验。所引用的机制多为相关性发现或动物模型结果，其在人类中的普适性和因果链条尚需更多功能性研究证实。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::985cab2b009c52150a529179"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0532"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::e29eef617749cc8ea9ecb1b0",
          "source_handle": "P0532",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits"
          ],
          "value": {
            "contribution": "识别了关键的微生物标志物（如Bifidobacterium, Akkermansia, Fusobacterium）及其在不同治疗背景下的双向作用（增强疗效或导致耐药/毒性）。",
            "limits": "许多微生物-治疗关联仅在特定肿瘤类型或特定实验条件下观察到，存在显著的异质性。综述未提供具体的预测模型或标准化的临床干预方案。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::985cab2b009c52150a529179"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0532"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::c12092fd56c97aaaa22d771f",
          "source_handle": "P0532",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits"
          ],
          "value": {
            "contribution": "强调了微生物干预的临床转化挑战，包括个体差异、安全性（如FMT风险）、标准化缺失及AI应用的潜力。",
            "limits": "对于如何解决这些挑战的具体技术路径（如AI模型的具体架构、工程菌的安全阈值）仅做概念性探讨，未提供实证数据支持。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::985cab2b009c52150a529179"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0532"
