          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::e7f22d9bd792b22114d77cc5"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0534"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::badff7011b3a302ca2c5e042",
          "source_handle": "P0534",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ],
          "value": "传统生物标志物（如PD-L1、TMB）无法充分解释ICI疗效的异质性；需要理解肠道微生物组是否不仅是相关性指标，而是可被重塑以影响免疫状态和治疗的宿主决定因素，以及目前的证据基础在方法学上存在哪些优势与局限。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::e7f22d9bd792b22114d77cc5"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0534"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::c044873b9ecec12e1c285594",
          "source_handle": "P0534",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ],
          "value": "人类实体肿瘤患者，聚焦肠道微生物组（Gut Microbiome）与免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）疗效及毒性的关联。涵盖黑色素瘤、非小细胞肺癌、肾细胞癌、肝细胞癌等实体瘤类型。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::e7f22d9bd792b22114d77cc5"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0534"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::b13ae81092a39b50e2e4a02d",
          "source_handle": "P0534",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ],
          "value": "本文是一篇二次定性综述（Secondary Qualitative Review），旨在综合临床证据，探讨肠道微生物组如何作为宿主决定因素影响实体瘤患者的免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）反应、生存期及毒性。研究通过结构化搜索PubMed、Europe PMC等数据库并结合引文追踪，筛选出15项主要临床研究进行主题合成。文章未进行定量荟萃分析，而是从响应表型、生态干扰（如抗生素/益生菌暴露）和治疗性工程化（如FMT、饮食干预）三个主题出发，评估微生物组调节的机制合理性与临床可行性。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::e7f22d9bd792b22114d77cc5"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0534"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::8161bac800ee67bffb51c02a",
          "source_handle": "P0534",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "仅基于15项研究的定性合成，非定量荟萃分析；具体菌种的普适性受限，不能直接外推至所有实体瘤亚型；未提供具体的效应量数值。",
            "contribution": "提供了关于肠道微生物组特征与ICI疗效关联的主题综合。指出响应者通常具有高多样性和特定有益菌（Akkermansia, Faecalibacterium等）富集，而抗生素暴露与较差预后相关。同时强调了不同肿瘤类型间具体菌种的不一致性，提示需关注生态整体而非单一标记物。",
            "facet_id": "F1"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::e7f22d9bd792b22114d77cc5"
