        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::b9c08ebf69f13f06d0cf38c6",
          "source_handle": "P0546",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "FMT干预",
            "finding": "临床前显示FMT可将非响应者微生物转移给无菌小鼠从而恢复PD-1疗效；临床试验（如NCT03353402, NCT03341143）显示FMT联合PD-1抑制剂可使部分难治性黑色素瘤患者获得客观缓解，并改变肠道及肿瘤微环境的免疫细胞浸润。但存在严重不良事件风险（如耐药菌感染、死亡）。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::b4fe98bf4129f2a01928c2de",
            "snapshot::49f12e61cfb8da920f6cf528"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch5",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_005\\c8a8e196a35945b70bab58ac7d25825d55761abfe16e04e3930ca8753de1bb61\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0546"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::6a1935c1fa786f0d5c27a8ee",
          "source_handle": "P0546",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "益生菌/菌群制剂",
            "finding": "特定菌株（如Bifidobacterium, Lactobacillus）联合ICI治疗在某些癌症（如肾癌、NSCLC）的临床试验中显示出改善ORR/PFS的趋势；某些菌株（如Blautia obeum）与不良预后或结肠炎风险增加相关。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::b4fe98bf4129f2a01928c2de",
            "snapshot::49f12e61cfb8da920f6cf528"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch5",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_005\\c8a8e196a35945b70bab58ac7d25825d55761abfe16e04e3930ca8753de1bb61\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0546"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::522c1a8223671dc609d86668",
          "source_handle": "P0546",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "益生元/饮食",
            "finding": "抗性淀粉（RS）等益生元促进有益菌生长及SCFA产生，增强化疗/放疗疗效并降低炎症因子；高纤维饮食与黑色素瘤患者更好的PD-1响应率相关；嘌呤核苷肌苷（Inosine）被鉴定为改善ICI疗效的关键代谢物。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::b4fe98bf4129f2a01928c2de",
            "snapshot::49f12e61cfb8da920f6cf528"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch5",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_005\\c8a8e196a35945b70bab58ac7d25825d55761abfe16e04e3930ca8753de1bb61\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0546"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::364b743ad363cbb93437d55d",
          "source_handle": "P0546",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ],
          "value": "review",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::b4fe98bf4129f2a01928c2de",
            "snapshot::49f12e61cfb8da920f6cf528"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch5",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_005\\c8a8e196a35945b70bab58ac7d25825d55761abfe16e04e3930ca8753de1bb61\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0546"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::139e6b53b9edcfaa318dc0e4",
          "source_handle": "P0546",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ],
          "value": "1. 肠道微生物组如何影响宿主免疫系统及抗肿瘤免疫？2. 肠道微生物组的组成和功能如何解释患者对ICIs治疗的异质性反应？3. 有哪些策略可以调节肠道微生物群以提高ICIs的疗效或减轻毒性？",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::b4fe98bf4129f2a01928c2de",
            "snapshot::49f12e61cfb8da920f6cf528"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch5",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_005\\c8a8e196a35945b70bab58ac7d25825d55761abfe16e04e3930ca8753de1bb61\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0546"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::f13f4ff62bafa7356cc1fc5d",
          "source_handle": "P0546",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ],
          "value": "肠道微生物组（Gut microbiome）与宿主免疫系统及癌症的相互作用，特别是其对免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）疗效的影响。涵盖机制探讨（先天/适应性免疫、肿瘤微环境）及干预策略（FMT、益生菌、益生元、饮食/生活方式）。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::b4fe98bf4129f2a01928c2de",
            "snapshot::49f12e61cfb8da920f6cf528"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch5",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_005\\c8a8e196a35945b70bab58ac7d25825d55761abfe16e04e3930ca8753de1bb61\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0546"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::243c66c5adc1973443e09f34",
          "source_handle": "P0546",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ],
          "value": "本文是一篇综述，旨在总结肠道微生物组在调节宿主免疫和癌症治疗反应中的最新知识。文章首先阐述了肠道微生物如何通过局部和全身途径影响宿主免疫系统（包括先天性和适应性免疫），并进一步讨论其在肿瘤微环境（TME）中对抗肿瘤免疫的作用。随后，文章评估了通过粪便微生物移植（FMT）、益生菌、益生元以及饮食和生活方式改变来调节肠道微生物群以改善ICIs疗效的临床前证据和临床试验进展，并讨论了相关的安全性和未来挑战。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::b4fe98bf4129f2a01928c2de",
            "snapshot::49f12e61cfb8da920f6cf528"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch5",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_005\\c8a8e196a35945b70bab58ac7d25825d55761abfe16e04e3930ca8753de1bb61\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0546"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::98b5ea781331e8ac5aa78af9",
          "source_handle": "P0546",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "所引用的临床试验多为早期探索性研究，样本量小，且结果存在异质性。不能直接推断所有微生物干预均有效，需结合其他研究确认特定菌株或策略的普适性。",
            "contribution": "提供了肠道微生物组影响ICI疗效的具体干预策略及其临床现状。列举了FMT、益生菌（如V9, M9）、益生元（RS）及饮食（高纤维、发酵大豆）在多种实体瘤（黑色素瘤、肺癌、肠癌等）中的临床试验结果（引用Table 1）。指出高纤维饮食与PD-1响应率正相关，特定益生菌联合治疗可能改善ORR。",
            "facet_id": "F1"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::b4fe98bf4129f2a01928c2de",
            "snapshot::49f12e61cfb8da920f6cf528"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch5",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_005\\c8a8e196a35945b70bab58ac7d25825d55761abfe16e04e3930ca8753de1bb61\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0546"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::e09623aeb4d97eb72cc38807",
          "source_handle": "P0546",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "许多机制细节（如具体的交叉反应肽段、Inosine的确切受体通路）主要基于动物模型（无菌小鼠、人源化小鼠）或体外研究。在人类患者中的直接因果证据仍在积累中，综述本身未提供新的机制验证数据。",
            "contribution": "详细阐述了微生物调节ICI疗效的潜在生物学机制。包括：1) 局部免疫：通过PRRs激活先天免疫，诱导Treg/Th17分化及SIgA产生；2) 全身免疫：代谢物（SCFAs, BAs, Inosine）进入循环调节免疫细胞；3) 肿瘤微环境：通过抗原交叉反应（Cross-reactivity）激活抗肿瘤T细胞，或通过细胞因子（TNFα, IL-12等）重塑TME。",
            "facet_id": "F2"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::b4fe98bf4129f2a01928c2de",
            "snapshot::49f12e61cfb8da920f6cf528"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch5",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_005\\c8a8e196a35945b70bab58ac7d25825d55761abfe16e04e3930ca8753de1bb61\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0546"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::bfead1d510827947a5ceff6b",
          "source_handle": "P0546",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "介绍了肠道微生物组与宿主免疫系统的复杂互作网络，包括GALT组织、DCs、T细胞亚群（Treg, Th17）的功能及代谢物（SCFAs, AMPs）的作用。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::b4fe98bf4129f2a01928c2de",
            "snapshot::49f12e61cfb8da920f6cf528"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch5",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_005\\c8a8e196a35945b70bab58ac7d25825d55761abfe16e04e3930ca8753de1bb61\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0546"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::9022ab3593d8b05c04816d74",
          "source_handle": "P0546",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "指出当前领域面临的挑战：患者队列差异大、测序方法不统一（16S vs WGS）、参考数据库差异、FMT的安全性风险（耐药菌传播）、以及外源性因素（抗生素、饮食）的干扰。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::b4fe98bf4129f2a01928c2de",
            "snapshot::49f12e61cfb8da920f6cf528"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch5",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_005\\c8a8e196a35945b70bab58ac7d25825d55761abfe16e04e3930ca8753de1bb61\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0546"
        },
        {
