          "source_handle": "P0547",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "黑色素瘤无关联、HCC依赖肝炎状态的例外发现。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::e8d01d45808cf092b87f9be9"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch4",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_004\\b995d57956e84cb840b6d426921fbc748165b7d5bcb76b80cd617161c4b4a22f\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0547"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::78b670f8dba4d118dcf3f52e",
          "source_handle": "P0547",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "该研究为观察性系统综述，发现的关联不等于因果关系。抗生素使用可能与疾病严重程度或共病有关，而不仅仅是微生物群破坏所致。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::e8d01d45808cf092b87f9be9"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch4",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_004\\b995d57956e84cb840b6d426921fbc748165b7d5bcb76b80cd617161c4b4a22f\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0547"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::9724329df5ec041f960e30f6",
          "source_handle": "P0547",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "黑色素瘤中的阴性结果不应被忽视，它挑战了“抗生素必然损害ICI疗效”的简单假设，需在综述中谨慎处理以避免过度概括。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::e8d01d45808cf092b87f9be9"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch4",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_004\\b995d57956e84cb840b6d426921fbc748165b7d5bcb76b80cd617161c4b4a22f\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
