          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::e2fab793e472b9f3fa70686a"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0548"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::00cba23fe33326a8afaffed4",
          "source_handle": "P0548",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ],
          "value": "作为一篇综述文章，本文采用叙事性综合的方法。作者通过检索和筛选相关文献（具体检索流程未在材料中交代），将现有研究分为几个主题板块：1) 微生物与免疫系统的基础互作机制（包括分子模拟、代谢物信号通路等）；2) 微生物-肿瘤-免疫轴的促癌与抗癌双重角色；3) 微生物对特定免疫细胞亚群（如T细胞、NK细胞、巨噬细胞）抗肿瘤功能的具体调控；4) 临床证据汇总，分析微生物特征（多样性、特定菌属）与ICIs疗效（ORR, PFS, OS）及不良反应的相关性，以及抗生素使用的负面影响。文章未进行新的实验或Meta分析，而是对已发表的研究结果进行归纳、比较和解释。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::e2fab793e472b9f3fa70686a"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0548"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::787457fc1170939f53518524",
          "source_handle": "P0548",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits"
          ],
          "value": {
            "contribution": "提供了肠道微生物调节抗肿瘤免疫的多层次机制框架，涵盖了从分子模拟、代谢物信号传导到免疫细胞亚群调控的具体路径。",
            "limits": "所给摘要未交代具体的文献检索策略、纳入排除标准及质量评估方法，因此无法判断其证据综合的系统性或偏倚风险。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::e2fab793e472b9f3fa70686a"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0548"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::6f9880830a7eb56d75a651e6",
          "source_handle": "P0548",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits"
          ],
          "value": {
            "contribution": "汇总了不同癌症类型中微生物特征与ICIs疗效关联的临床观察数据，指出了微生物多样性及特定菌属作为生物标志物的潜力。",
            "limits": "临床数据多为回顾性队列或小型前瞻性研究，因果关系尚未完全确立；不同研究间微生物检测方法和分析标准的异质性可能导致结果难以直接比较。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::e2fab793e472b9f3fa70686a"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0548"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::7348f623093679531c171ccd",
          "source_handle": "P0548",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits"
          ],
          "value": {
            "contribution": "讨论了抗生素使用对免疫治疗的双重影响，强调了癌症类型和治疗时机的关键作用。",
            "limits": "关于抗生素效应的结论在不同研究中存在矛盾（如在某些肿瘤中有益，在其他中有害），作者承认这种差异可能与肿瘤免疫原性（TMB）有关，但未能提供统一的解释模型。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::e2fab793e472b9f3fa70686a"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0548"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::fd27b2468c418b6a8c340897",
          "source_handle": "P0548",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits"
          ],
          "value": {
            "contribution": "提出了基于微生物组的个性化治疗策略方向，如FMT、益生菌补充和微生物筛查。",
            "limits": "目前缺乏标准化的供体选择标准、最佳菌群组合配方以及长期安全性数据，这些仍是该领域的重大局限性。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::e2fab793e472b9f3fa70686a"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
