          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::e2fab793e472b9f3fa70686a"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0548"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::0bdb771acce2d6ea9ab17052",
          "source_handle": "P0548",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ],
          "value": "尽管已有大量证据表明肠道微生物影响癌症患者的免疫治疗响应，但其根本机制尚不完全清楚，且微生物对治疗的效应具有双重性（既可能增强也可能抑制疗效）。本研究试图厘清这些复杂机制，为设计改善临床预后的微生物特异性治疗策略提供理论依据。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::e2fab793e472b9f3fa70686a"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0548"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::91c0e8cdba4fcd6ee220f3b0",
          "source_handle": "P0548",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ],
          "value": "肠道微生物群（Gut Microbiota）及其代谢产物与宿主免疫系统、肿瘤发生发展及全身性癌症治疗（特别是免疫检查点抑制剂ICIs和化疗）之间的相互作用。涵盖从基础免疫机制到临床疗效预测的多个层面。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::e2fab793e472b9f3fa70686a"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0548"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::0323fb011673255d303b26f8",
          "source_handle": "P0548",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ],
          "value": "该综述旨在系统梳理肠道微生物群如何通过调节全身性和抗肿瘤免疫反应，进而影响癌症进展及对系统性治疗（尤其是免疫检查点抑制剂）的响应。文章首先阐述了肠道微生物在维持免疫稳态、促进T细胞分化（如Tregs, Th1, Th17）中的基础作用；随后探讨了微生物-肿瘤-免疫轴的双向关系，包括促癌和抗癌机制；重点分析了特定菌种及其代谢物对先天性和适应性抗肿瘤免疫的影响；最后汇总了临床前和临床研究证据，讨论微生物组成多样性、特定菌株丰度以及抗生素使用对ICIs疗效和毒性的影响，并提出了基于微生物组的个性化治疗策略前景。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::e2fab793e472b9f3fa70686a"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0548"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::f4afca9cf86d8636a5daf124",
          "source_handle": "P0548",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "这些关联主要基于回顾性队列和小规模前瞻性研究，存在混杂因素（如饮食、合并用药）未完全控制的风险。不同癌症类型的效应方向不一致，不能简单外推至所有实体瘤。",
            "contribution": "提供了肠道微生物多样性及特定菌属丰度与ICIs疗效（ORR, PFS, OS）关联的临床观察证据。具体包括：在黑色素瘤、肾细胞癌和非小细胞肺癌中，高多样性或与特定有益菌（如双歧杆菌、阿克曼氏菌）正相关；而在结直肠癌等肿瘤中，抗生素使用可能具有不同的影响模式。还提到了FMT从应答者转移到无应答者能恢复疗效的案例。",
            "facet_id": "F1"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::e2fab793e472b9f3fa70686a"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0548"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::33ece1750db86a1d0ce7a270",
          "source_handle": "P0548",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "许多机制细节来自动物模型或体外实验，其在人体内的确切效力和普遍性尚待验证。部分机制（如分子模拟）虽被提出，但在临床样本中的直接证据仍有限。",
            "contribution": "详细阐述了微生物调节抗肿瘤免疫的具体机制，包括：1) 分子模拟导致微生物抗原与肿瘤新抗原交叉反应，激活CD8+ T细胞；2) 代谢物（如SCFAs、吲哚衍生物）通过表观遗传修饰（HDAC抑制）或受体信号（TLR, AhR）调节Treg/Th17平衡及树突状细胞成熟；3) 特定细菌直接作用于免疫细胞（如通过Fap2蛋白抑制NK细胞，或通过SagA酶激活NOD2通路）。",
            "facet_id": "F2"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::e2fab793e472b9f3fa70686a"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0548"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::cc8bb04d83488e2ed0a7e474",
          "source_handle": "P0548",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "抗生素效应具有癌症类型依赖性（如在CRC/HCC中可能有益），且不同研究定义的“抗生素暴露”窗口期和种类各异，需谨慎解读。",
            "contribution": "提供了抗生素使用对ICIs疗效负面影响的广泛临床证据汇总，包括多项大型回顾性研究和Meta分析结果，指出抗生素（特别是β-内酰胺类）在ICIs治疗前后使用与较差生存结局相关。",
            "facet_id": "F1"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::e2fab793e472b9f3fa70686a"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0548"
