        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::6ea15ea0aa6712ed0c9eb521",
          "source_handle": "P0566",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "使用抗生素或 PPI",
            "finding": "诱导菌群失调，显著降低 PFS 和 OS；抗生素在 ICI 启动前后 30-60 天使用影响最强。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::ba084eb01ffbfae5b25958c7"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0566"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::783f657ba50dbc2d934e71b6",
          "source_handle": "P0566",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "口腔/唾液微生物组",
            "finding": "预测价值有限且不一致；仅在局部晚期 NSCLC 接受放化疗联合免疫治疗的患者中观察到较高颊部微生物多样性与改善 PFS 的关联，而在转移性 ICI 单药治疗中无显著差异。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::ba084eb01ffbfae5b25958c7"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0566"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::6ab4403099f415c643bd0258",
          "source_handle": "P0566",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "功能性代谢标记 vs. 分类学标记",
            "finding": "功能性代谢能力（如 SCFA 产生通路）比单纯的分类学组成更可靠地预测 PFS；机器学习模型结合功能通路优于简单分类谱。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::ba084eb01ffbfae5b25958c7"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0566"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::ddb8a03eee58ddc3801977a2",
          "source_handle": "P0566",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ],
          "value": "review",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::ba084eb01ffbfae5b25958c7"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0566"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::bc58b5231303597a3760c61c",
          "source_handle": "P0566",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ],
          "value": "解决肺癌免疫治疗临床结局高度异质性的问题，特别是原发性/获得性耐药和免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）。旨在明确微生物组（尤其是肠道和口腔）能否作为非侵入性预测生物标志物，以优化 ICI 疗效并管理毒性。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::ba084eb01ffbfae5b25958c7"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0566"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::02909b647840efc2dba418aa",
          "source_handle": "P0566",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ],
          "value": "肺癌（主要为非小细胞肺癌 NSCLC，小细胞肺癌 SCLC 数据缺失）患者接受免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗时的肠道和口腔/呼吸道微生物组。研究范围涵盖微生物组成、多样性、功能代谢物、临床混杂因素（抗生素、PPI）以及作为预测生物标志物的潜力。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::ba084eb01ffbfae5b25958c7"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0566"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::cb10a6832f9807d6009cd8c5",
          "source_handle": "P0566",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ],
          "value": "这是一篇叙事性综述，旨在综合评估微生物组作为肺癌免疫治疗疗效和毒性预测生物标志物的证据。文章系统梳理了肠道和口腔微生物组在 ICI 治疗中的角色，重点分析了特定菌属（如 Akkermansia muciniphila）、微生物多样性及代谢产物（如短链脂肪酸、肌苷）与无进展生存期（PFS）和总生存期（OS）的关联。同时，综述讨论了抗生素和质子泵抑制剂（PPI）对微生物组的破坏作用及其对预后的负面影响，并探讨了从单一物种标记向复合评分模型转变的趋势，以及粪菌移植（FMT）等干预策略的早期临床数据。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::ba084eb01ffbfae5b25958c7"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0566"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::bb97eec65a48d4b515580494",
          "source_handle": "P0566",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "证据多为观察性关联，因果推断受限；口腔微生物组的阳性结果仅限于特定治疗组合（放化疗+免疫），不可外推至所有 ICI 场景；SCLC 数据缺失。",
            "contribution": "提供了肠道微生物组特征（高 alpha 多样性、特定有益菌）与 ICI 疗效（PFS/OS 改善）的正向关联证据，以及抗生素/PPI 暴露与疗效下降的负向关联证据。同时指出口腔微生物组在 ICI 单药治疗中预测价值有限，但在联合治疗中可能有信号。",
            "facet_id": "F1"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::ba084eb01ffbfae5b25958c7"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0566"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::57ee940b9154bb8ebec71f77",
          "source_handle": "P0566",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "许多机制细节源自黑色素瘤或胰腺癌的临床前模型，在 NSCLC 中的直接临床验证不足；部分代谢物（如 SCFAs）的作用具有双重性或情境依赖性（如 butyrate 在黑色素瘤中可能有害，在肺癌中未直接评估）。",
            "contribution": "详细阐述了介导机制：微生物代谢物（SCFAs, inosine, Uro A）通过调节树突状细胞成熟、CD8+ T 细胞priming、TME 重塑及 gut-lung axis 通讯来增强抗肿瘤免疫。同时也提到了潜在的负面机制（如某些 SCFAs 增加 Tregs，LPS 促进 IL-6）。",
            "facet_id": "F2"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::ba084eb01ffbfae5b25958c7"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0566"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::faa138d638b4ef961b6eb3c4",
          "source_handle": "P0566",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "综述指出当前研究存在严重的异质性（测序平台、采样时间、生信流程），且多数研究未调整抗生素/PPI 等关键混杂因素。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::ba084eb01ffbfae5b25958c7"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0566"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::1fd06e0624ce56a056b016c7",
          "source_handle": "P0566",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "提及 FMT-LUMINate 试验等早期阶段 FMT 干预数据，显示在 PD-L1 高表达 NSCLC 患者中取得高客观缓解率。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::ba084eb01ffbfae5b25958c7"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0566"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::acb1f02292f978c4fafc718b",
          "source_handle": "P0566",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "该综述主要聚焦于 NSCLC，SCLC 的证据几乎空白，结论不能直接推广到小细胞肺癌。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::ba084eb01ffbfae5b25958c7"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0566"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::6310df1ab85c47992b704566",
          "source_handle": "P0566",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "口腔微生物组的预测价值具有高度的治疗情境依赖性（仅在联合治疗中可能有效），不能泛化为所有免疫治疗的通用标志物。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::ba084eb01ffbfae5b25958c7"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0566"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::e334203f3b602dbb33f589fa",
          "source_handle": "P0566",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "所引用的机制多来自其他肿瘤类型的临床前模型，在肺癌中的直接适用性需谨慎对待，作者已明确指出这一点。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::ba084eb01ffbfae5b25958c7"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0566"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::3e99ed01c95e2c5a4011ad60",
          "source_handle": "P0566",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "抗生素和 PPI 的影响是间接证据，综述未区分其对肠道和口腔微生物组的具体独立贡献。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::ba084eb01ffbfae5b25958c7"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
