          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0569"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::7d132168f655b05ea9b836b9",
          "source_handle": "P0569",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ],
          "value": "在早期可切除NSCLC患者中，基线肠道微生物组特征或治疗期间的纵向微生物组变化是否与对新辅助免疫检查点抑制剂的治疗反应（以MPR为代理终点）相关？",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::2c10f66e656b13b1d08f07b2"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0569"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::8d0fe6ca31f6eacced2def34",
          "source_handle": "P0569",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ],
          "value": "接受新辅助免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗的早期可切除非小细胞肺癌（NSCLC）患者；涉及两项前瞻性临床试验（J1772, J1414）的队列。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::2c10f66e656b13b1d08f07b2"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0569"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::00ea803d77a6f0246ba70920",
          "source_handle": "P0569",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ],
          "value": "该研究旨在探讨基线肠道微生物组（GM）特征及纵向变化与NSCLC患者新辅助ICI治疗反应之间的关系。既往研究多关注晚期NSCLC，而本研究的背景是早期阶段患者的关联尚不明确。研究团队收集了患者的粪便样本进行16S rRNA扩增子测序，分析基线微生物组特征以及治疗期间的纵向变化，并将其与主要病理缓解（MPR）这一临床结局指标相关联。通过Bootstrap分析计算“自相似性”得分以评估纵向稳定性，并使用DESeq进行功能分析以阐明相关的代谢通路。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::2c10f66e656b13b1d08f07b2"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0569"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::a7bcf65d2d78fd39792bf20d",
          "source_handle": "P0569",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "仅限早期可切除NSCLC的新辅助治疗场景；样本量较小；主要关联而非因果证明；未区分具体ICI药物组合的影响。",
            "contribution": "提供了早期NSCLC新辅助ICI治疗中，特定微生物组特征（低基线Alpha多样性、高纵向稳定性、SCFA通路富集）与较好治疗反应（MPR）正相关的证据。",
            "facet_id": "F1"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::2c10f66e656b13b1d08f07b2"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0569"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::d73035d76945fb89e4bcc339",
          "source_handle": "P0569",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "仅为相关性发现，未直接验证因果关系；功能分析基于16S测序推断，分辨率有限；未深入探讨SCFA如何具体调节抗肿瘤免疫反应。",
            "contribution": "提示短链脂肪酸（SCFA）产生相关的代谢通路可能与更好的治疗反应有关，为微生物组调节免疫治疗效应的潜在机制提供了线索。",
            "facet_id": "F2"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::2c10f66e656b13b1d08f07b2"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0569"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::26fbf8a06245821bc9efd6a0",
          "source_handle": "P0569",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "基线Alpha多样性、纵向自相似性得分、SCFA代谢通路丰度与MPR的关联。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::2c10f66e656b13b1d08f07b2"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0569"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::4e7ac253237edc51757cfa09",
          "source_handle": "P0569",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "该研究针对的是早期可切除NSCLC的新辅助治疗，其结论不能直接推广到晚期转移性NSCLC的一线治疗或其他实体瘤。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::2c10f66e656b13b1d08f07b2"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0569"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::b038ba0b74ad1088927cbfb0",
          "source_handle": "P0569",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "基线Alpha多样性与预后的负相关（低多样性对应好预后）可能与部分晚期NSCLC研究中观察到的正相关（高多样性对应好预后）存在差异，需考虑疾病阶段、治疗强度及宿主状态的差异，不可简单视为矛盾，而应视为情境依赖的特征。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::2c10f66e656b13b1d08f07b2"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0569"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::b9d2c99c35f1bbb60f7e7782",
          "source_handle": "P0569",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "样本量较小（n=23），统计效力有限，发现的关联需在更大队列中验证。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::2c10f66e656b13b1d08f07b2"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0569"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::19dcbc1b9d7fe05e7add2de5",
          "source_handle": "P0569",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "纵向稳定性指标（自相似性）的计算方法独特，其普适性和与其他稳定性指标的相关性未知。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
